Some of you want to know who I am, where I came from. The others are satisfied to accept

00:43:20.950 --> 00:43:26.570
me because of my works. Am willing to follow blindly, providing I guarantee your safety."

00:43:26.570 --> 00:43:30.000
"There's no way he could have."

00:43:30.120 --> 00:43:36.440
known. Only now have we voiced our choices and put them to a vote. You, sire, are the

00:43:36.440 --> 00:43:42.520
most skeptical of all, with the possible exception of Commander Adama who escorted me here. Therefore,

00:43:43.350 --> 00:43:50.690
I will grant you your first wish before you have decided on your third. I will deliver

00:43:50.690 --> 00:43:52.900
your enemy unto you this night.

00:43:54.600 --> 00:43:55.280
Why?

00:44:16.030 --> 00:44:18.410
- Any further news of these machines?

00:44:18.410 --> 00:44:21.280
These creatures' manifestations?

00:44:21.280 --> 00:44:24.370
- Our attack crafts are unable to pursue them.

00:44:24.370 --> 00:44:27.140
They are too swift.

00:44:27.140 --> 00:44:29.480
- Prepare my personal craft and crew.

00:44:30.000 --> 00:44:36.450
Send her a long-range signal unidirectionally to the Galactica, wherever she is.

00:44:37.970 --> 00:44:41.050
Notify her that I wish to rendezvous with her.

00:44:42.020 --> 00:44:47.760
You expect to be treated under universal law after leading your brothers into annihilation of the colonies?

00:44:49.040 --> 00:44:53.900
It is my life that I risk. Do as I must ask.

00:44:54.550 --> 00:44:56.340
By your command, Baltar.

00:45:11.100 --> 00:45:12.300
the fleet to full alert.

00:45:13.070 --> 00:45:13.590
Yes, sir.

00:45:13.910 --> 00:45:14.370
What is it?

00:45:14.390 --> 00:45:14.750
What's happened?

00:45:15.500 --> 00:45:19.630
I have just received a direct communique from Baltar.

00:45:20.040 --> 00:45:20.510
What?

00:45:22.250 --> 00:45:26.420
Requesting permission to come aboard the Galactica under a universal sign of truce.

00:45:29.700 --> 00:45:30.000
Launched.

00:45:30.000 --> 00:45:38.000
Blue Squadron 2, escort Walter aboard.

00:45:38.000 --> 00:45:41.060
This is an event unlike any we've experienced

00:45:41.060 --> 00:45:44.010
since the destruction of our civilization.

00:45:44.010 --> 00:45:46.630
Walter's ship is reaching our quadrant

00:45:46.630 --> 00:45:48.870
and is being intercepted by an elite squadron

00:45:48.870 --> 00:45:51.010
which will escort the treasonous instrument

00:45:51.010 --> 00:45:54.540
of our holocaust directly into our hands.

00:45:54.540 --> 00:45:56.330
Word is spreading like sunbursts

00:45:56.330 --> 00:45:58.010
through every corner of the fleet.

00:45:58.010 --> 00:46:00.000
It's a jubilation unprecedented.

00:46:00.190 --> 00:46:05.930
As Baltar has brought before the Council of Twelve, it is just as Count Evie promised.

00:46:05.930 --> 00:46:09.410
Our enemy has been delivered.
